- Trade Ideas section: Another set of idea cards
- Footer with columns: Products (Supercharts, Screeners, Pine Script, Heatmaps, Calendars), Community (Social Network, Ideas, Indicators & Strategies, Editors' Picks), Markets (Stocks, ETFs, Crypto, Forex, Futures, Bonds, Economy), Brokers (Top Brokers, Broker Comparison, Special Offers), Company (About, Blog, Careers, Media Kit), Legal (Terms of Use, Privacy Policy, Cookies Policy, Disclaimer). Footer bottom with copyright.

Tab switching JS: When clicking tabs in market summary, community ideas, or indicators sections, show/hide content panels. Use vanilla JS inline at the bottom.

The tab switching must be functional JavaScript. Use this pattern:
```javascript
document.querySelectorAll('[data-tabs]').forEach(tabGroup => {
  const tabs = tabGroup.querySelectorAll('.tab, .pill-tab');
  const panelContainer = document.getElementById(tabGroup.dataset.tabs);
  tabs.forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
      tab.classList.add('active');
      if (panelContainer) {
        panelContainer.querySelectorAll('.tab-panel').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));
        const target = panelContainer.querySelector('#' + tab.dataset.target);
        if (target) target.classList.add('active');
      }
    });
  });
});
```

Use market-summary-card class for index cards displayed horizontally. Use sparkline SVG placeholders (simple polyline paths). Make sure all the exact data values from source_brief.md are used. Use proper positive/negative coloring.

The page should be a complete, production-quality HTML file. Do NOT use any external JS libraries. Use the CSS classes already defined in styles.css.

